# Force LF for every text file, regardless of a checkout's core.autocrlf.
#
# Found 2026-09-17 building Einklinken E2: without this, a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true silently rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout, so a
# sha256 computed against the working tree (as packets/INDEX.json and every
# receipt's evidence[].sha256 do) stops matching the committed blob - not a
# tamper, just a platform default. This repo has contributors and guests on
# both platforms and hash-pins content in several places (packet/receipt
# index, probe receipts), so this is not optional.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats: never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
